{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Garmin Connect",
  "description": {
    "en": "Garmin watches, scales and health data (steps, sleep, Body Battery) in Gladys.",
    "fr": "Montres, balances et données santé Garmin (pas, sommeil, Body Battery) dans Gladys.",
    "de": "Garmin-Uhren, -Waagen und Gesundheitsdaten (Schritte, Schlaf, Body Battery) in Gladys.",
    "es": "Relojes, básculas y datos de salud Garmin (pasos, sueño, Body Battery) en Gladys."
  },
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/gboulvin/gladys-garminconnect:2.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gboulvin/Gladys-GarminConnect/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["services", "environment"],
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Your Garmin Connect account",
        "fr": "Votre compte Garmin Connect",
        "de": "Ihr Garmin Connect-Konto",
        "es": "Su cuenta Garmin Connect"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Enter the credentials of your Garmin Connect account. Garmin offers no public API to individuals: the integration signs in like the Garmin Connect app and only reads your data. With two-step verification, save, then run the \"Sign in\" action twice: once to receive the code, once with the code.",
        "fr": "Saisissez les identifiants de votre compte Garmin Connect. Garmin ne propose pas d’API publique aux particuliers : l’intégration se connecte comme l’application Garmin Connect et ne fait que lire vos données. Avec la vérification en deux étapes, enregistrez puis lancez deux fois l’action « Se connecter » : une fois pour recevoir le code, une fois avec le code.",
        "de": "Geben Sie die Zugangsdaten Ihres Garmin Connect-Kontos ein. Garmin bietet Privatpersonen keine öffentliche API: Die Integration meldet sich wie die Garmin Connect-App an und liest Ihre Daten nur. Mit Zwei-Faktor-Verifizierung speichern Sie und führen die Aktion „Anmelden“ zweimal aus: einmal, um den Code zu erhalten, einmal mit dem Code.",
        "es": "Introduzca las credenciales de su cuenta Garmin Connect. Garmin no ofrece API pública a particulares: la integración inicia sesión como la aplicación Garmin Connect y solo lee sus datos. Con la verificación en dos pasos, guarde y ejecute dos veces la acción «Iniciar sesión»: una para recibir el código y otra con el código."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://connect.garmin.com/",
          "label": {
            "en": "Garmin Connect",
            "fr": "Garmin Connect",
            "de": "Garmin Connect",
            "es": "Garmin Connect"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Email",
        "fr": "E-mail",
        "de": "E-Mail",
        "es": "Correo electrónico"
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. name@example.com",
        "fr": "ex. nom@exemple.fr",
        "de": "z. B. name@beispiel.de",
        "es": "p. ej. nombre@ejemplo.es"
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "Password",
        "fr": "Mot de passe",
        "de": "Passwort",
        "es": "Contraseña"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Only sent to Garmin to sign in; the session is then kept in the integration volume.",
        "fr": "Envoyé uniquement à Garmin pour se connecter ; la session est ensuite conservée dans le volume de l’intégration.",
        "de": "Wird nur zur Anmeldung an Garmin gesendet; die Sitzung wird danach im Volume der Integration gespeichert.",
        "es": "Solo se envía a Garmin para iniciar sesión; después la sesión se guarda en el volumen de la integración."
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "domain",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Garmin region",
        "fr": "Région Garmin",
        "de": "Garmin-Region",
        "es": "Región de Garmin"
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "garmin.com",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "garmin.com",
          "label": {
            "en": "International (garmin.com)",
            "fr": "International (garmin.com)",
            "de": "International (garmin.com)",
            "es": "Internacional (garmin.com)"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "garmin.cn",
          "label": {
            "en": "China (garmin.cn)",
            "fr": "Chine (garmin.cn)",
            "de": "China (garmin.cn)",
            "es": "China (garmin.cn)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "timezone",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Time zone",
        "fr": "Fuseau horaire",
        "de": "Zeitzone",
        "es": "Zona horaria"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Time zone of your Garmin account, to know which day \"today\" is.",
        "fr": "Fuseau horaire de votre compte Garmin, pour savoir quel jour est « aujourd’hui ».",
        "de": "Zeitzone Ihres Garmin-Kontos, um zu wissen, welcher Tag „heute“ ist.",
        "es": "Zona horaria de su cuenta Garmin, para saber qué día es «hoy»."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. Europe/Paris",
        "fr": "ex. Europe/Paris",
        "de": "z. B. Europe/Berlin",
        "es": "p. ej. Europe/Madrid"
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "Europe/Paris"
    },
    {
      "key": "poll_frequency",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Synchronization interval (s)",
        "fr": "Intervalle de synchronisation (s)",
        "de": "Synchronisierungsintervall (s)",
        "es": "Intervalo de sincronización (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often Garmin Connect is read, in seconds (5 minutes minimum: Garmin limits its API).",
        "fr": "Fréquence de lecture de Garmin Connect, en secondes (5 minutes minimum : Garmin limite son API).",
        "de": "Wie oft Garmin Connect gelesen wird, in Sekunden (mindestens 5 Minuten: Garmin begrenzt seine API).",
        "es": "Frecuencia de lectura de Garmin Connect, en segundos (5 minutos mínimo: Garmin limita su API)."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 900,
      "min": 300,
      "max": 86400
    },
    {
      "key": "body_battery_low_threshold",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Low Body Battery threshold",
        "fr": "Seuil de Body Battery faible",
        "de": "Schwelle für niedrige Body Battery",
        "es": "Umbral de Body Battery baja"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The \"Body Battery low\" scene trigger fires when the level drops below this value.",
        "fr": "Le déclencheur de scène « Body Battery faible » se déclenche quand le niveau passe sous cette valeur.",
        "de": "Der Szenenauslöser „Body Battery niedrig“ wird ausgelöst, wenn der Wert unter diese Schwelle fällt.",
        "es": "El disparador de escena «Body Battery baja» se activa cuando el nivel baja de este valor."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 20,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 100
    },
    {
      "key": "device_language",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Language of device names",
        "fr": "Langue des noms d’appareils",
        "de": "Sprache der Gerätenamen",
        "es": "Idioma de los nombres de dispositivos"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Language of the device and feature names created in Gladys.",
        "fr": "Langue des noms d’appareils et de fonctionnalités créés dans Gladys.",
        "de": "Sprache der in Gladys erstellten Geräte- und Funktionsnamen.",
        "es": "Idioma de los nombres de dispositivos y funciones creados en Gladys."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "en",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "en",
          "label": {
            "en": "English",
            "fr": "Anglais",
            "de": "Englisch",
            "es": "Inglés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "fr",
          "label": {
            "en": "French",
            "fr": "Français",
            "de": "Französisch",
            "es": "Francés"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "de",
          "label": {
            "en": "German",
            "fr": "Allemand",
            "de": "Deutsch",
            "es": "Alemán"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "es",
          "label": {
            "en": "Spanish",
            "fr": "Espagnol",
            "de": "Spanisch",
            "es": "Español"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "sign_in",
      "label": {
        "en": "Sign in",
        "fr": "Se connecter",
        "de": "Anmelden",
        "es": "Iniciar sesión"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 90,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "mfa_code",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Verification code (if requested)",
            "fr": "Code de vérification (si demandé)",
            "de": "Bestätigungscode (falls angefordert)",
            "es": "Código de verificación (si se solicita)"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "e.g. 123456",
            "fr": "ex. 123456",
            "de": "z. B. 123456",
            "es": "p. ej. 123456"
          },
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "test_connection",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the connection",
        "fr": "Tester la connexion",
        "de": "Verbindung testen",
        "es": "Probar la conexión"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60
    },
    {
      "key": "sync_now",
      "label": {
        "en": "Synchronize now",
        "fr": "Synchroniser maintenant",
        "de": "Jetzt synchronisieren",
        "es": "Sincronizar ahora"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60
    },
    {
      "key": "sign_out",
      "label": {
        "en": "Sign out",
        "fr": "Se déconnecter",
        "de": "Abmelden",
        "es": "Cerrar sesión"
      }
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "activity_completed",
      "label": {
        "en": "Garmin activity completed",
        "fr": "Activité Garmin terminée",
        "de": "Garmin-Aktivität beendet",
        "es": "Actividad Garmin completada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A new activity (run, ride, walk...) was synced to Garmin Connect.",
        "fr": "Une nouvelle activité (course, vélo, marche...) a été synchronisée sur Garmin Connect.",
        "de": "Eine neue Aktivität (Lauf, Radfahrt, Spaziergang...) wurde mit Garmin Connect synchronisiert.",
        "es": "Se sincronizó una nueva actividad (carrera, bici, caminata...) en Garmin Connect."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "activity_type",
          "type": "multi_select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Activity type",
            "fr": "Type d'activité",
            "de": "Aktivitätstyp",
            "es": "Tipo de actividad"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "running",
              "label": {
                "en": "Running",
                "fr": "Course à pied",
                "de": "Laufen",
                "es": "Carrera"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "cycling",
              "label": {
                "en": "Cycling",
                "fr": "Vélo",
                "de": "Radfahren",
                "es": "Ciclismo"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "walking",
              "label": {
                "en": "Walking",
                "fr": "Marche",
                "de": "Gehen",
                "es": "Caminata"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "hiking",
              "label": {
                "en": "Hiking",
                "fr": "Randonnée",
                "de": "Wandern",
                "es": "Senderismo"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "swimming",
              "label": {
                "en": "Swimming",
                "fr": "Natation",
                "de": "Schwimmen",
                "es": "Natación"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "strength",
              "label": {
                "en": "Strength training",
                "fr": "Renforcement musculaire",
                "de": "Krafttraining",
                "es": "Entrenamiento de fuerza"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "other",
              "label": {
                "en": "Other",
                "fr": "Autre",
                "de": "Andere",
                "es": "Otra"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "activity_type",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Activity type",
            "fr": "Type d'activité",
            "de": "Aktivitätstyp",
            "es": "Tipo de actividad"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "activity_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Activity name",
            "fr": "Nom de l'activité",
            "de": "Name der Aktivität",
            "es": "Nombre de la actividad"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "distance_km",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Distance (km)",
            "fr": "Distance (km)",
            "de": "Distanz (km)",
            "es": "Distancia (km)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "duration_minutes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Duration (min)",
            "fr": "Durée (min)",
            "de": "Dauer (min)",
            "es": "Duración (min)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "calories",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Calories",
            "fr": "Calories",
            "de": "Kalorien",
            "es": "Calorías"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "average_hr",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Average heart rate",
            "fr": "Fréquence cardiaque moyenne",
            "de": "Durchschnittliche Herzfrequenz",
            "es": "Frecuencia cardíaca media"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "step_goal_reached",
      "label": {
        "en": "Daily step goal reached",
        "fr": "Objectif de pas quotidien atteint",
        "de": "Tägliches Schrittziel erreicht",
        "es": "Objetivo diario de pasos alcanzado"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The steps of the day reached the goal set in Garmin Connect (once a day).",
        "fr": "Les pas du jour ont atteint l’objectif fixé dans Garmin Connect (une fois par jour).",
        "de": "Die Schritte des Tages haben das in Garmin Connect festgelegte Ziel erreicht (einmal täglich).",
        "es": "Los pasos del día alcanzaron el objetivo fijado en Garmin Connect (una vez al día)."
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "steps",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Steps",
            "fr": "Pas",
            "de": "Schritte",
            "es": "Pasos"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "step_goal",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Step goal",
            "fr": "Objectif de pas",
            "de": "Schrittziel",
            "es": "Objetivo de pasos"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "body_battery_low",
      "label": {
        "en": "Body Battery low",
        "fr": "Body Battery faible",
        "de": "Body Battery niedrig",
        "es": "Body Battery baja"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The Body Battery dropped below the threshold of the configuration.",
        "fr": "La Body Battery est passée sous le seuil de la configuration.",
        "de": "Die Body Battery ist unter die Schwelle der Konfiguration gefallen.",
        "es": "La Body Battery bajó del umbral de la configuración."
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "body_battery",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Body Battery",
            "fr": "Body Battery",
            "de": "Body Battery",
            "es": "Body Battery"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "threshold",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Threshold",
            "fr": "Seuil",
            "de": "Schwelle",
            "es": "Umbral"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "sleep_recorded",
      "label": {
        "en": "Night of sleep recorded",
        "fr": "Nuit de sommeil enregistrée",
        "de": "Schlafnacht aufgezeichnet",
        "es": "Noche de sueño registrada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Last night’s sleep reached Garmin Connect (usually when the watch syncs in the morning).",
        "fr": "La nuit de sommeil est arrivée sur Garmin Connect (en général à la synchro du matin).",
        "de": "Der Schlaf der letzten Nacht ist in Garmin Connect angekommen (meist bei der Synchronisierung am Morgen).",
        "es": "El sueño de anoche llegó a Garmin Connect (normalmente al sincronizar por la mañana)."
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "sleep_hours",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Sleep duration (h)",
            "fr": "Durée de sommeil (h)",
            "de": "Schlafdauer (h)",
            "es": "Duración del sueño (h)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "sleep_score",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Sleep score",
            "fr": "Score de sommeil",
            "de": "Schlafwert",
            "es": "Puntuación del sueño"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "weigh_in_recorded",
      "label": {
        "en": "New weigh-in",
        "fr": "Nouvelle pesée",
        "de": "Neue Wiegung",
        "es": "Nuevo pesaje"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A new weigh-in (Index scale or manual entry) reached Garmin Connect.",
        "fr": "Une nouvelle pesée (balance Index ou saisie manuelle) est arrivée sur Garmin Connect.",
        "de": "Eine neue Wiegung (Index-Waage oder manuelle Eingabe) ist in Garmin Connect angekommen.",
        "es": "Un nuevo pesaje (báscula Index o entrada manual) llegó a Garmin Connect."
      },
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "weight_kg",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Weight (kg)",
            "fr": "Poids (kg)",
            "de": "Gewicht (kg)",
            "es": "Peso (kg)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "body_fat",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Body fat (%)",
            "fr": "Masse grasse (%)",
            "de": "Körperfett (%)",
            "es": "Grasa corporal (%)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "bmi",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "BMI",
            "fr": "IMC",
            "de": "BMI",
            "es": "IMC"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "device_synced",
      "label": {
        "en": "Garmin device synced",
        "fr": "Appareil Garmin synchronisé",
        "de": "Garmin-Gerät synchronisiert",
        "es": "Dispositivo Garmin sincronizado"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A Garmin device uploaded its data to Garmin Connect.",
        "fr": "Un appareil Garmin a envoyé ses données sur Garmin Connect.",
        "de": "Ein Garmin-Gerät hat seine Daten an Garmin Connect übertragen.",
        "es": "Un dispositivo Garmin subió sus datos a Garmin Connect."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "device",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Device",
            "fr": "Appareil",
            "de": "Gerät",
            "es": "Dispositivo"
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "device_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Device name",
            "fr": "Nom de l'appareil",
            "de": "Gerätename",
            "es": "Nombre del dispositivo"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "scene_actions": [
    {
      "key": "sync_now",
      "label": {
        "en": "Synchronize Garmin Connect",
        "fr": "Synchroniser Garmin Connect",
        "de": "Garmin Connect synchronisieren",
        "es": "Sincronizar Garmin Connect"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Read Garmin Connect now and update the devices.",
        "fr": "Interroge Garmin Connect maintenant et met à jour les appareils.",
        "de": "Garmin Connect jetzt abfragen und die Geräte aktualisieren.",
        "es": "Consulta Garmin Connect ahora y actualiza los dispositivos."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "synced",
          "type": "boolean",
          "label": {
            "en": "Synchronized",
            "fr": "Synchronisé",
            "de": "Synchronisiert",
            "es": "Sincronizado"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "steps",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Steps",
            "fr": "Pas",
            "de": "Schritte",
            "es": "Pasos"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "body_battery",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Body Battery",
            "fr": "Body Battery",
            "de": "Body Battery",
            "es": "Body Battery"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "get_daily_summary",
      "label": {
        "en": "Get the Garmin daily summary",
        "fr": "Lire le résumé quotidien Garmin",
        "de": "Garmin-Tageszusammenfassung lesen",
        "es": "Leer el resumen diario de Garmin"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Today’s values (steps, sleep, heart rate, Body Battery...) for the next actions.",
        "fr": "Les valeurs du jour (pas, sommeil, fréquence cardiaque, Body Battery...) pour les actions suivantes.",
        "de": "Die Werte des Tages (Schritte, Schlaf, Herzfrequenz, Body Battery...) für die nächsten Aktionen.",
        "es": "Los valores del día (pasos, sueño, frecuencia cardíaca, Body Battery...) para las siguientes acciones."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "refresh",
          "type": "boolean",
          "label": {
            "en": "Synchronize first",
            "fr": "Synchroniser d'abord",
            "de": "Zuerst synchronisieren",
            "es": "Sincronizar primero"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Read Garmin Connect now instead of using the last synchronization.",
            "fr": "Interroge Garmin Connect maintenant au lieu d’utiliser la dernière synchronisation.",
            "de": "Garmin Connect jetzt abfragen, statt die letzte Synchronisierung zu verwenden.",
            "es": "Consulta Garmin Connect ahora en lugar de usar la última sincronización."
          },
          "default": false
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "date",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Date",
            "fr": "Date",
            "de": "Datum",
            "es": "Fecha"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "steps",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Steps",
            "fr": "Pas",
            "de": "Schritte",
            "es": "Pasos"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "step_goal",
